---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 7, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy" description="How TechOnPlay (techonplay.com) uses cookies.">
  <section class="container legal-page">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This Cookie Policy explains what cookies are, how TechOnPlay
        (techonplay.com) uses them, and your choices
        regarding their use. By using our website, you consent to the use of
        cookies as described in this policy.
      </p>

      <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small text files that are stored on your computer or
        mobile device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make
        websites work more efficiently and to provide information to the
        owners of the site.
      </p>

      <h2>How We Use Cookies</h2>
      <p>TechOnPlay uses cookies for a few reasons:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Essential cookies:</strong> necessary for the website to function properly.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> we use Google Analytics to understand how visitors interact with our content — which pages are popular and how people navigate the site. This data is aggregated.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising cookies:</strong> we monetize our content using Google AdSense. These cookies track browsing habits to show relevant ads.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Advertising and Third-Party Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Google AdSense</strong> — we use Google AdSense to serve
        advertisements. Google uses cookies to display ads based on your
        prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of
        advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based
        on your visit to TechOnPlay and/or other sites on the internet. You may
        opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
        {' '}<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ad Settings</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Affiliate links</strong> — some articles may contain
        affiliate links. If you click one of these links, a cookie may be
        placed on your device to track a subsequent purchase, allowing us to
        earn a small commission at no extra cost to you.
      </p>

      <h2>How to Control Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to accept or reject cookies. Most browsers let
        you refuse all or some cookies, or alert you when a site sets or
        accesses them. You can also opt out of third-party vendors' use of
        cookies for interest-based advertising by visiting
        {' '}<a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>.
        Please note that if you disable or refuse cookies, some parts of
        this website may become inaccessible or not function properly.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. We encourage you
        to review this page periodically for any changes.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about our use of cookies? Reach out through our
        {' '}<a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-block: 56px 80px;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin: 12px 0 32px;
  }
</style>
